      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Alstead once hosted one of New Hampshire’s first paper mills, founded in 1793 by Ephraim and Elisha Kingsbury, which burned down in 1880.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
