      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Shedd‑Porter Memorial Library, built in 1910 in a neo‑classic revival style, was a gift from native son John G. to Alstead and neighboring Langdon.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        12,
